{
  "description": "The download endpoint accepts a config-scoped Service Token without project/config query parameters, as documented at https://docs.doppler.com/reference/secrets-download. Its default JSON response is a dictionary of secret names to string values, not a structure limited to the four example keys in the upstream schema.",
